WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.020
- Okay, Jesse, for all
those "Bachelor" fans,

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.830
what do we have to look forward to?

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.687
- Is Clayton gonna end up with his person

00:00:06.687 --> 00:00:08.560
or is it all gonna fall apart?

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.720
- I do sense a cliffhanger.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.430
Is it all gonna just blow up

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.950
and nobody's gonna get that final rose?

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:15.900
- That's the crazy part.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.007
We actually still don't
know what's going to happen.

00:00:18.007 --> 00:00:20.900
- You don't have to tell me
who, if it was up to you,

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.400
that you would pick for Clayton?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.987
- I'm like telling him.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.698
- And is he listening?

00:00:26.698 --> 00:00:28.980
- It's selective hearing.
- Mm hmm.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.219
And do the fans have a favorite?

00:00:31.219 --> 00:00:32.970
- I think honestly right now
it's really up in the air.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.200
I think it could be Rachel
or it could be Gabby.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.330
- Well, as they say in the
song, it's the final countdown.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:40.723
Thank you, Jesse.
(beep)

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:45.103
Who's gonna get that rose?
(laughing)

